flowchart LR
  U[Users] --> WEB[React + TypeScript]
  WEB --> NGINX[Nginx /api proxy]
  NGINX --> API[ASP.NET Core modular monolith]
  API --> SQL[(SQL Server OLTP\nSource of Truth)]
  API <--> REDIS[(Redis\nCache + Rate Limits)]
  API --> RMQ[RabbitMQ]
  RMQ --> WORKER[Notification Worker]
  WORKER --> SQL

  SQL --> ETL[Python incremental ETL]
  AIRFLOW[Airflow] -. orchestrates .-> ETL
  ETL --> MINIO[(MinIO RAW/Bronze)]
  MINIO --> SPARK[Spark / PySpark]
  SPARK --> DWH[(PostgreSQL DWH\nAnalytical, not 1:1)]
  DWH --> MART[Star Schema + Data Marts]
  MART --> DQ[Data Quality + Reconciliation]
  DQ --> PBI[Power BI]

  API -. telemetry .-> OTEL[OpenTelemetry]
  OTEL --> PROM[Prometheus]
  OTEL --> LOKI[Loki]
  PROM --> GRAFANA[Grafana]
  LOKI --> GRAFANA

  DWH --> PGVECTOR[pgvector]
  PGVECTOR --> RAG[RAG + Ollama]
  RAG --> AIAPI[AI API .NET / Python]
  AIAPI --> WEB
  AIAPI -. traces .-> LANGFUSE[Langfuse]

  SQL -. future CDC .-> DEBEZIUM[Debezium]
  DEBEZIUM -. future streaming .-> KAFKA[Kafka]
  KAFKA -. future sink .-> MINIO
  DBT[dbt optional] -. SQL models .-> DWH
  PLATFORM[Kubernetes / Terraform / Cloud / Lakehouse] -. future deployment .-> API

